  m_Name: TaurusDialogue1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueList:
  - Welcome to Scary Oaks Hiking and Greenery.
  - We hope that you're enjoying your stay.
  - Oh, hey, you're a human, right?
  - Cool.
  - Yeah, you're not supposed to be here.
  - Hm.
  - Well, I mean, as long as you're here, you might as well have fun and enjoy the
    mazes.
  - Just gotta get to the end, then you'll be done.
  - Oh, and have an upgrade.
  - Compliments of Scary Oaks Hiking and Greenery.
  - You can carry an additional marker with you now.
  - Happy trails.
  - ...
  - The upgrade is to the right of me. As you can see, I have no legs.
  sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 63e5263019facb04c86fc73a3adc1085, type: 3}
